# Safe-C GCC Plugin Auto-Loading Specs File
# This file instructs GCC/G++ to load the Safe-C plugin by default for all compilations.
# To disable Safe-C, pass -DSAFE_C_DISABLE, -fplugin-arg-safe_c-disable, or set SAFE_C_DISABLE=1.

*cc1_options:
+ %{!DSAFE_C_DISABLE:%{!DSAFE_CPP_DISABLE:%{!fplugin-arg-safe_c-disable:%{!fplugin-arg-safe_cpp-disable:-fplugin=safe_c}}}}

*cc1plus_options:
+ %{!DSAFE_C_DISABLE:%{!DSAFE_CPP_DISABLE:%{!fplugin-arg-safe_c-disable:%{!fplugin-arg-safe_cpp-disable:-fplugin=safe_c}}}}

*link:
+ %{!DSAFE_C_DISABLE:%{!DSAFE_CPP_DISABLE:%{!fplugin-arg-safe_c-disable:%{!nodefaultlibs:%{!nostdlib:-lsafe_c_rt}}}}}
